{"title":"Tribeca Spruce Artificial Christmas Trees","description":"\u003ch3\u003e\n\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003eBring Classic Holiday Charm Home with Tribeca Spruce Blue Artificial Christmas Trees\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"483\" data-start=\"89\"\u003eInspired by the natural beauty of the Colorado Blue Spruce, the Tribeca Spruce Blue collection brings a fresh and distinctive look to traditional holiday décor. Designed with rich bluish-green foliage and classic silhouette, these trees capture the charm and warmth of a real evergreen while adding subtle cool-toned color variation that sets them apart from traditional green trees. \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"696\" data-start=\"485\"\u003eAvailable in both full and slim silhouettes, this collection is designed to suit a variety of spaces, from grand living rooms to narrower layouts where a slim profile makes a more elegant fit. \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 data-end=\"1944\" data-start=\"1881\" data-section-id=\"1wtrx\"\u003eWhy choose a Tribeca Spruce Blue artificial Christmas tree?\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2228\" data-start=\"1946\"\u003eThe Tribeca Spruce Blue is perfect for those seeking a traditional artificial Christmas tree with a slightly more distinctive and elevated appearance. Its unique blue-green coloring adds character and dimension while still maintaining the timeless charm of a classic evergreen tree. Its full classic needles, offers a nostalgic Christmas tree feel that is warm and inviting throughout the holiday season.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2409\" data-start=\"2230\"\u003eDesigned for lasting beauty and effortless setup, the Tribeca Spruce Blue allows you to enjoy the warmth and joy of the holiday season without the maintenance of a real Christmas tree.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 data-end=\"2578\" data-start=\"2411\"\u003eShould I choose a full or slim Tribeca Spruce Blue?\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Tribeca Spruce Blue collection is available in both full and slim silhouettes to suit different spaces and decorating preferences.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Tribeca Spruce Blue (full) provides a wide, traditional Christmas tree shape with a bold, lush appearance. Its fuller profile gives you ample space for \u003ca title=\"Christmas Ornaments\" href=\"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/collections\/christmas-ornaments\"\u003eornaments\u003c\/a\u003e, \u003ca title=\"Christmas Ribbons\" href=\"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/collections\/ribbons\"\u003eribbon\u003c\/a\u003e, and decorative garland making it ideal for an open space where you want the tree to serve as a holiday focal point.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Tribeca Spruce Blue Slim delivers the same beautiful blue-green foliage and classic silhouette in a narrower, more upright profile. It is a great option for apartments, smaller rooms, hallways, or entryways where a full-width tree would feel oversized without giving up the distinctive color and character that makes the Tribeca Spruce Blue so special.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eHow long does it take to shape the Tribeca Spruce Blue?\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLike most 100% PVC artificial Christmas trees, the Tribeca Spruce Blue benefits from a dedicated shaping session during initial setup. Plan to spend up to 3 hours working through the branches, separating, fanning and positioning each tip to build out the fullness. \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOnce properly shaped, the Tribeca Spruce Blue looks full and lush from top to bottom. Many customers find that after the first season, the branches hold part of their shape and subsequent setups take significantly less time.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eWhat decorating style works best with the Tribeca Spruce Blue?\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2228\" data-start=\"1946\"\u003eThe Tribeca Spruce Blue offers a full range of decorating possibilities. Its blue-green foliage pairs naturally with icy, white and winter-inspired palettes. Warm gold and copper accents offer a striking contrast, while classic red and green offers a traditional feel with a twist.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2228\" data-start=\"1946\"\u003e\u003ca title=\"Decorative Picks\" href=\"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/collections\/picks\"\u003eTree picks\u003c\/a\u003e and ribbon, in gold or complimentary tones add beautiful layers of texture and depth throughout the branches. Its full classic needles holds ornaments, picks, and decorative garland with ease and because the branches are easy to shape and position, you have full creative control over the final look.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 data-end=\"2228\" data-start=\"1946\"\u003eIs the Tribeca Spruce Blue available pre-lit or unlit?\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2228\" data-start=\"1946\"\u003eThe Tribeca Spruce collection is available in both pre-lit and unlit options to accommodate your decorating preferences. \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2228\" data-start=\"1946\"\u003eOur pre-lit Tribeca Spruce Blue Christmas trees feature professionally installed lighting that glows warmly through the blue-green foliage, creating a beautiful and unique holiday ambience. With Power Pole Technology, set up is seamless. No tangled cords, no complicated connections. Simply assemble, connect and your tree lights up instantly.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 data-end=\"2228\" data-start=\"1946\"\u003eIs the Tribeca Spruce Blue easy to assemble and store?\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYes. The Tribeca Spruce Blue is designed for easy setup and long term use. Its hinged branch construction allows branches to fall naturally into place during assembly, giving you a solid foundation to build on as you work through the shaping process.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEach tree includes a sturdy tree stand as well as complimentary setup gloves to help you shape and arrange the branches comfortably during assembly. A complimentary storage bag is also included to keep your tree protected between seasons.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhen the holidays are over, the Tribeca Spruce Blue disassembles easily and stores neatly in its included storage bag. Keep it in a cool, dry place to preserve its condition for many seasons to come. \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eExplore the Tribeca Spruce Blue collection and find the size and silhouette that brings the cool, distinctive beauty of the Colorado Blue Spruce into your home this holiday season. \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e","products":[{"product_id":"7-foot-tribeca-blue-spruce-tree-unlit","title":"7' Tribeca Blue Spruce Artificial Christmas Tree Unlit","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring the joy and natural beauty of a Colorado winter into your home with our Tribeca Spruce, inspired by the magnificent Colorado Blue Spruce. Expertly handcrafted with meticulous attention to detail, each tree flawlessly replicates the bluish-green needles and elegant form of a genuine Blue Spruce tree. Perfect for festive gatherings, it adds warmth, charm, and holiday cheer to any space.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"7' \/ Full \/ Unlit","offer_id":28642912370752,"sku":"TBS-T7-U","price":259.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/FlockedGroup-7_6c9c086e-64f5-4fa3-a9cb-87024542db20.jpg?v=1718158603"},{"product_id":"7-foot-tribeca-blue-spruce-tree-led","title":"7' Tribeca Blue Spruce Artificial Christmas Tree with 550 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring the joy and natural beauty of a Colorado winter into your home with our Tribeca Spruce, inspired by the magnificent Colorado Blue Spruce. Expertly handcrafted with meticulous attention to detail, each tree flawlessly replicates the bluish-green needles and elegant form of a genuine Blue Spruce tree. Perfect for festive gatherings, it adds warmth, charm, and holiday cheer to any space.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"