ings, it adds warmth, charm, and holiday cheer to any space.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"8' \/ Slim \/ LED","offer_id":42902224535752,"sku":"TBS-SL-T8-L","price":399.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/TribecaSlimLED_3e9fcaff-8935-41a3-8ba6-3e6d4005bea5.jpg?v=1722014308"},{"product_id":"9-foot-tribeca-blue-spruce-slim-tree-unlit","title":"9' Tribeca Blue Spruce Slim Artificial Christmas Tree Unlit","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring the joy and natural beauty of a Colorado winter into your home with our Tribeca Spruce, inspired by the magnificent Colorado Blue Spruce. Expertly handcrafted with meticulous attention to detail, each tree flawlessly replicates the bluish-green needles and elegant form of a genuine Blue Spruce tree. Perfect for festive gatherings, it adds warmth, charm, and holiday cheer to any space.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"9' \/ Slim \/ Unlit","offer_id":42902224634056,"sku":"TBS-SL-T9-U","price":399.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/TribecaSlimUnlit_4de9bb03-b044-4fc6-a7e0-36b7b34619cf.jpg?v=1722014318"},{"product_id":"9-foot-tribeca-blue-spruce-slim-tree-led","title":"9' Tribeca Blue Spruce Slim Artificial Christmas Tree with 650 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring the joy and natural beauty of a Colorado winter into your home with our Tribeca Spruce, inspired by the magnificent Colorado Blue Spruce. Expertly handcrafted with meticulous attention to detail, each tree flawlessly replicates the bluish-green needles and elegant form of a genuine Blue Spruce tree. Perfect for festive gatherings, it adds warmth, charm, and holiday cheer to any space.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"9' \/ Slim \/ LED","offer_id":42902224666824,"sku":"TBS-SL-T9-L","price":499.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/TribecaSlimLED_8cb54fa4-48ab-4757-9baf-84cc74f539ba.jpg?v=1722014311"}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/collections\/Blue_Spruce.jpg?v=1722361841","url":"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/collections\/tribeca-spruce-trees.oembed","provider":"King of Christmas","version":"1.0","type":"link"}